{
 "_about": "The Editor's searches and the Object Window's columns, one way for the Python Editor and the viewer's: run by tests/test_search_cases.py (EditorSession.search, column_overlay, columns.table as editorlink composes it, workflow.search_all / replace_all / filter_choices) and viewer-shell/editcore/tests/cases.rs (editcore::search, editcore::columns). Each case is a load order (`plugins`, each with its records) and operations: [\"search\", tag, query, limit?], [\"columns\", tag], [\"search_all\", text, whole, limit?], [\"replace_all\", hits or \"last\" (the last search_all's), text, by, whole], [\"filter_choices\"], [\"set\", tag, id, path, value], [\"choose\", tag, id, path, plugin] (a field taken from a plugin), [\"whole\", tag, id, plugin], [\"insert\", tag, id], [\"pending\"]. `expect` is what each gave and the journal after them. Pinned as the Python does it: the search matches a record's deleting version too (a later plugin's DELETED record is the version searched). Generated from the Python side when a case is added, and read by hand.",
